{
  "key": 32458,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000481_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "This is where spirits rest.\n",
        "Please be quiet and respectful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000481_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Lost Tower.\r",
        "There is a persistent fog that thickens\n",
        "the higher you climb.\r",
        "If you can’t use the hidden move Defog\n",
        "and you have no business here, there\f",
        "is no need to go up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower1F_Text_FantinaNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina: Not yet, mon ami.\n",
        "Ze tower is not ready for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower1F_Text_FantinaTheyCry",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina: Every night I sit here.\n",
        "Ze dead, zey cry now.\r",
        "Someone must listen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower1F_Text_FantinaSadMan",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina: Once a month, a sad man\n",
        "brings flowers to a grave upstairs.\r",
        "He never speaks. I do not ask."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower1F_Text_SarosBirthday",
      "en_US": [
        "Saros: Happy birthday, Mira.\n",
        "You'd have been nine today."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower1F_Text_SarosOneMorning",
      "en_US": [
        "Saros: Dialga can give me back one\n",
        "morning. The morning before.\r",
        "That's all I want.\r",
        "Just one morning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower2F_Text_GruntVein",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Boss heard there's a\n",
        "whole vein down there.\r",
        "Grab everything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower2F_Text_RowanFast",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I came as fast as I could.\r",
        "They knew about the vein?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower2F_Text_RowanOnlyThree",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...Cyrus has been in there\n",
        "the whole time.\r",
        "He couldn't have told anyone.\r",
        "...Someone is listening,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "My line, the tower... I don't know."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower2F_Text_RowanWasntHim",
      "en_US": "Rowan: ...It wasn't him."
    },
    {
      "id": "LostTower2F_Text_RowanGo",
      "en_US": "Rowan: Go. Bring him back."
    }
  ]
}
